%% Billing — redeeming a promotion code. Every failure gets the same answer.
flowchart TD
  A[Person submits a code] --> B{Locked out?\n10 failures in the last hour}
  B -- yes --> X[Same answer: that code is not valid]
  B -- no --> C{Right length?\nlookup by keyed digest on this platform}
  C -- no / not found --> F[Count a failure] --> X
  C -- found --> D[Lock the promotion]
  D --> E{Active, open, not used up,\nnot used by this person,\nnew member if required?}
  E -- no --> F
  E -- yes --> G[Credit::Grant: promotional lot,\nexpiry from days, purposes]
  G --> H[Redemption row, unique per person\nredemptions_count + 1]
  H --> I[Credit appears on the person's credit page]
